# Keep the Docker build context (and hence the R source tarball built
# inside it) limited to actual package content. Loose scratch/export files
# that sometimes end up at the repo root -- e.g. HTML exports with
# full-width colons in their names -- fail R CMD check's "checking for
# portable file names" step if they get copied into the image.
/*.html
/*.html:Zone.Identifier
/*.txt
/CHANGES.md
/HADOLINT_FIXES.md
/Dockerfile.pinned
/Dockerfile.pinned_and_linted

.git
.Rproj.user
*.Rproj
docs
